&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll work as part of our Trust &amp;amp; Safety team, helping build and improve Responsible Gaming tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll build and maintain React-based Responsible Gaming tools&lt;/li&gt;
